  description: '"The stadium is now open, and our all-star ladies are ready to take
    you out to the ball game! It''s the beginning of a new baseball legend!

    Presenting:
    The three navigators of the Power Pro world! That''s Paa-chan on the left, bright,
    energetic, and (usually) dependable. On the right we''ve got Waa-chan, calm,
    earnest, and level-headed (usually...). And Namiki is in charge up front with
    little Chikuwa in her tote bag, helping us cheer everyone on!"'
